{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0d22e1cd0e03a3b3282d9198349a59975552e708ee2572550818b6fcc61dfcb4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6144a6364f71a9428992bfe4dd0659a5e813caca5536b8471454d9fda11d6a3a","slc_831c8921dc2aea45b82d877d0f968697966f29392bd8eeadca26a33b3a2b4aa1"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"On trivial builds the planning overhead makes thrifty cost more than a single capable agent, so there is a crossover below which one strong model should be used directly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_23fdabe6257e0e5116c77c4805a98c88db5786313a6c22d9927b086755fcdf02","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a48e5b892aed930ea1dbeab040bd9de8dab34715c980ae61cac756e6e515fb3a"],"source_ids":["src_525ef2c2a1e95f88b352a14232233234"],"text":"Repository development practice: the project follows SemVer with the version in .claude-plugin/plugin.json as source of truth, and every release bumps it so /plugin installs pick up changes cleanly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2fa35724d27f405e600481dd18aba87b7d22d3dd7a71fdee8f0f3388eb7276f3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3c1ee75439a683d7a0cf17cf08398a06db3c82f144062775f801de83d7ee88b2"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The lean dispatch flow uses dispatch.py to run bare claude -p calls that hard-pin every codegen sprint to Haiku regardless of the plan's tier, writing outputs to disk while the orchestrator reads only a tiny manifest.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_353a15c273003ed6bc0a8531189294e598af3e99fcbf787ea1f93b8e3f89fd42","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_17d4160a2940f81a5af53993255689b178983703d0d444c00d08cb57aa513b73","slc_2fad64814dcd103662b1e74306bb36c9bc3969abcfddbab12c82f19e67001003","slc_bed7d2668968ed979ac589be249066d4284d9bb8847375af7ea84d4c5ed8750d"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The README reports the dispatch flow is about 64% cheaper than Opus building the same spec at equal gate quality, benchmarked across 7 tasks spanning JS, Python, Go, and prose, with results in eval/RESULTS.md and scripts in experiments/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4349eb8d1acccfe0c7179cb1c8621b8d95d1f9e7d898265ae010d3784090668b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8a6bcc40a51f5ee94a453787f19364fd4c0869fa2ba45ed805fd79f47639be56","slc_ca859070d560e34710bba1be9ed69fabdaf4097ac70313e848a3d28293ee4ab4"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors can hack locally by symlinking the skills directories into ~/.claude/skills/ instead of installing the plugin.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_441ddfefd9d678ec632cecefb19d0bdd3d4a10b7e62941a46fdfe822f107309e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ec85be6b08b79dba010fa8172a89a07c35e76471bcae9cad2b2bb3c27b7abffc"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"Core philosophy: concentrate planning in a strong model and push execution to a cheap one, with a gate (tests/checklist) re-run independently rather than self-reported as the trust contract.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a73ec95d2b9d973887323b5336ef2386d1e438db2e70bb4b9e78586ef777305a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8d5650a4959f97a1e3e08d2e7a626d937725ac725b2e04b334cef340c8408d14","slc_ac7a837dc0ad08a28624211ae3051705c06155a7a604d85ccb88dd5f5c49d6e2"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"Verification is adaptive: runnable criteria are checked by re-running the gate at no model cost; Sonnet checkers are spent only on gate failures or assertional criteria such as prose and design quality.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b05e8fba92a522a56957765172c6940fe881ae06f72005244ff21dc9f8937dc4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_02e45e821db04c0cbc0c7180ffe0888e14fdfd7da006feb0b70bcef7d2b8e0e5"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"In the subagent flow the executor model cannot be forced in code; a runtime may silently ignore the requested Haiku model, self-reported model is a weak signal, and observed cost/usage is the authoritative check.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bb231c1945669950152dff2457d2d71bcdaa111c96580a71c641b19715aa051e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_33a58f270375db0e29594a59a692ef617c923526ed0eaa81e4a79b948c06b5ac","slc_6144a6364f71a9428992bfe4dd0659a5e813caca5536b8471454d9fda11d6a3a"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The planner (Sonnet) writes a contract plus sprints.jsonl with one self-contained unit of work per sprint, pinning cross-sprint and genuinely ambiguous decisions so the executor never invents system-level choices.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c04fb626212fc5561db71551095cc61f7d00e9dfc1c46c10ca80a05eea2e1ef1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_573312a7ed1789342f476087956fd9e3a853d88658a9d608909c0e99875bd0ab","slc_b9cec53da66e715bf1f53d96486957e51d5d539ef028087980c0ba8bcdbc9dfb","slc_e26bb20ec40b99536bdf4b443c060a45470cf7383d77c7614c75a043fc6caf5d"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The fix loop is bounded: up to 2 surgical Sonnet fixes, 1 executor redo with fresh Haiku, 1 architect replan, then escalation to the human; a regression guard rolls back fixes that break previously-passing criteria.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_caf64bb1bd518bd5a1f8b37466930885ef5d245def9480aded31afd14c68f62f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5126c4f2660de3c5d25b49f5f6cd5fb385584883908d1e8b6ae4062efd2496d3","slc_6ecf28ede839d6a48302c37bf4faec5b3c4527a5b6b0a3e9c620b9896dea76b9"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"thrifty installs as a Claude Code plugin via /plugin marketplace add 2389-research/thrifty and /plugin install thrifty@thrifty, triggered by phrases like 'thrifty', 'delegate this', or 'tiered build'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e0377273fce875b241edf866eda8db47085bb257dfd98e63c08377265771c865","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5fc394c75eb161c3651a63d3de4e09e74d08e44c7ca2f679cb0d0460054f1468","slc_cedb34880f8cf73d39e01930098fa8fd8299362deb17e600bd3fac61b0a3084f"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The plugin bundles six skills: thrifty and thrifty-dispatch (orchestrators), thrifty-plan (Sonnet), thrifty-brief (Sonnet, split tier), thrifty-execute (Haiku), and thrifty-check (Sonnet), with orchestrators running in-session.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eab430e721c1e70b7353787f380ef995830f7e9dda9d353e5140bece88198282","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_054181a79b7de678194591bd8b0efb85b6fc29795dd1d991054ee465fa05883c","slc_084ace05c8d047081e6df872a0536f28c2f8739bc3006548d1285b859f7125ee"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The architect picks a decomposition mode by artifact cohesion: partition (parallel separate regions), relay (sequential shared artifact), or layered (sequential role-specialized passes).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eb606ce0c67baaba579e2f6b08ab5a7af068859f2896bc960eb946f2543953f7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e2cd1c1bf42a71ccbe8da9cea2b74012deac02d4b173a373bd1d0d626404ee5c"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"Run artifacts (CONTRACT.md, briefs/, LEDGER.md) are written under docs/thrifty/<task-slug>/ so a run is auditable and resumable.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fa26fbe7781addc61ab981fb7fb788e36ad508049d1e02f83191a2f786e3c1f7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"2389-research/thrifty@f7d6c4463c6d snapshot e5c1fe9c72e06cb4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ab5741e1c5e7b48f7a03877b1f560f8bcc618ad2594aeb41cf2aab80035afd1"],"source_ids":["src_f818c182c7b35646840aad704c826852"],"text":"The subagent-based skills need no external runtime, but the lean thrifty-dispatch flow shells out to dispatch.py and additionally requires Python 3 on PATH.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_69fb5dcb06e24c1a836280ef3f29592c"}
